<rule>
  <description>GitHub Remote and Live URL for the Personal Portfolio</description>
  <instructions>
    - The live URL for this personal website/portfolio is https://apisit-man.github.io.
    - When performing Git operations (such as pushing code), always ensure the target repository is `apisit-man/apisit-man.github.io`.
